rem Iterative Circle Packing
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=199
rem Find the fraction of the unit circle
rem left uncovered after Steps rounds of
rem filling the gaps between tangent
rem circles, to eight decimal places

use numbers
use sequences
use io
use cli

option Steps integer = 10

rem Three equal circles of curvature K
rem fill the unit circle. Descartes
rem gives the circle in a gap of three
rem tangent curvatures a, b, c as
rem a + b + c + 2 sqrt(ab + bc + ca),
rem and every new circle opens three
rem gaps. Areas are taken over pi.
K = 1 + 2 / 3 ** 0.5
Out = 0.0 - 1
A = array Out Out Out K
B = array K K K K
C = array K K K K
Covered = 3 / (K * K)
for Step in 1 to Steps
  Near = A * B + B * C + C * A
  New = A + B + C + 2 * (Near sqrt)
  Covered += (1 / (New * New)) sum
  A = concat A B A
  B = concat B C C
  C = concat New New New
end
Answer = (1 - Covered) 8 round
Answer print
